    "sentence": {
      "en": "The Pace: 6.4% of papers in leading journals named AI methods in the 13 weeks to 12 Jul. That is up from 1.1% in 2015 to 2019, and up from 4.7% a year earlier. Clearly above the pre-AI level in 5 of 7 fields. Too few cases to judge in 1.",
